  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #532, #534.\n\nRemoves a closed pocket's interior by a stated pattern of wire passes so no core drops, with a minimum wire clearance to the walls as a parameter. Each pass verifies against the walls.\n\n**Done means:** a pocket burns out with no core region left, and a clearance below the kerf is refused. Golden committed.",
